# A notification while the app is put away (mbui's src/host/win_notify.cpp, win_app.c's frames while away): its window
# closed (to the notification area: the runner, e2e/win.sh notice_do), the test agent answers in the test chat (alice's
# other device asks it to: e2e/peer.ts send), the core says to show that turn's notice, the app shows it as the
# system's; tapped (as the system's tap is), the app comes back with the chat open at its answer.
timeout 60000
answered {"topic":"accounts"}
# (from here the app is as the host says: put away is not shown, going on)
hosted
#station log do: away
#station done away
#station timeout 120000
#station log do: say
#station done say
# (the turn's notice: the chat's title, what the agent did under it)
#station noticed 端到端测试
#station notice 端到端测试
#station shown
#station until 窗口收起时的回答
#station shot 6-noticed
exit
